{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2023-03-01 10:00:00', 'title': "SOUTHERN COMPANY AGAIN IS TOP-RANKED UTILITY ON FORBES MAGAZINE'S BEST LARGE EMPLOYERS IN AMERICA LIST", 'text': "ATLANTA , MARCH 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHERN COMPANY HAS BEEN NAMED THE TOP UTILITY ON FORBES MAGAZINE'S BEST LARGE EMPLOYERS IN AMERICA 2023 RANKINGS. SOUTHERN COMPANY RANKED NEARLY 100 PLACES HIGHER THAN THE NEXT PEER COMPANY LISTED IN THE UTILITIES GROUP BY FORBES."}